		<br>
	<</if>>
	<<if $spear_vessel is "Zephyr" and !($temple_spear_mission gte 2)>>
		<<ind>><<link [[창이 해적들에게 빼앗겼다고 조던에게 알린다|Temple Spear Zephyr]]>><</link>>
