<<pain 3>>
<br><br>
<<if (currentSkillValue('willpower') / 10) gte (($pain - 100) + random(1, 100))>>
	<span class="green">발바닥이 타는 것처럼 느껴지지만, 당신은 계속 가기로 마음먹는다.</span>
	<<gwillpower>><<willpower 1>>
	<br><br>
	<<templeicon "trialcontinue">><<link [[계속한다|Temple Firewalk 6]]>><<set Weather.Temperature.override.increase.inside(5)>><</link>><<gpain>>
